  m_Name: Glacier
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  DisplayName: Glacier
  Description: "A valley glacier \u2014 blue ice and leaning s\xE9racs between polished
    rock, crevasse fields and roaring moulins, striped moraines and a black rubble
    tongue ending in the ice mouth where the river is born; pilgrims cross by wand
    lines to ice-cave shrines"
